{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-reasoning-options#card-zh","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-reasoning-options","commit":"ec0d71c9922dda0627a87ac178a8a6827069a559","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Reasoning Options 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 的第三方模型路由辅助插件。它在 DSH 设置中扫描 pi-ai provider 配置，为匹配的 OpenCode HTTP(S) 路由补上缺失的 x-opencode-session 请求头，并保留已有请求头。插件提供 provider 推理强度下拉框，可将路由恢复为不传强度的 Default；也能选择开启，为未声明档位的自定义模型补齐 off 到 max。适合需要管理网关路由和推理选项的 DSH 用户；无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:107-175"]}
{"unit_id":"Scorp1o117__dsh-reasoning-options#card-en","repo":"Scorp1o117/dsh-reasoning-options","commit":"ec0d71c9922dda0627a87ac178a8a6827069a559","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Reasoning Options manages third-party routes in DSH Web and Desktop. It adds missing x-opencode-session headers to OpenCode routes, offers a provider Default that omits reasoning effort, and can optionally fill missing levels for custom pi-ai models. No extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:107-175"]}
